        <mxCell id="n_cu" value="&lt;b&gt;Tier CU — why it is preferred&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 100% of tables kept intact&lt;br&gt;• figures verbalized&lt;br&gt;• about half the list price&lt;br&gt;• cites by page range&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;hard limit: 300 pages per file&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F1FAF1;strokeColor=#107C10;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#323130;align=left;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=4;spacing=10;">
