        <mxCell id="n_di" value="&lt;b&gt;Tier DI+ — the capability fallback&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• no practical page ceiling&lt;br&gt;• Layout + Split + GA vision skill fills the figure gap&lt;br&gt;• cites the deepest heading&lt;br&gt;• a late failure loses the whole document's enrichment" vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F3FB;strokeColor=#5C2D91;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#323130;align=left;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=4;spacing=10;">
