        <mxCell id="n_split" value="&lt;b&gt;Why --split is the default choice&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• every part qualifies for Tier CU&lt;br&gt;• a vision failure costs one part, not a 900-page manual&lt;br&gt;• part names keep ORIGINAL page numbers, so citations stay correct" vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAF9F8;strokeColor=#605E5C;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#323130;align=left;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=4;spacing=10;">
